	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ex pluribus celebribusque amicis nihil ambigimus quin omnia de <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Augustanis commitiis certiora habeas, quam ego referre tibi possim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Mittere <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>tamen libuit candidi viri epistolam, illinc ad me ante dies octo scriptam; e qua <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>de plusculis certo intelliges, quomodo acciderint.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Pridie Granvellae <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>exenteratum cadaver magno comitatu Constantiam allatum est atque inde, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nescio an ferente Rheno an iumentis trahentibus, <placeName ref="l28">Basileam</placeName> asportabitur, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ut mox Montbelguardiam demumque Bisontium pretrahi possit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Illic <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>enim ossa quiescere voluit, ubi opum suarum reconditus est thesaurus; <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ubi quiescat anima et an quiescat, solus novit dominus.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Caesarem <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>aiunt rursum Monacum usque digressum e comitiis valde aegrotum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>et in morte Granvellae altero iam orbatum oculo; solum enim restare <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>putant ducem Albanensem, qui visum<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">a.R.: nisum?</note> ei insititium commendet.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Quid ei in <placeName ref="l2549">Africa</placeName> acciderit, e chartula meis literis inclusa intelli<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ges.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Minime vanus author est, qui illa perscripsit.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Mit hat ain frommer mann von Augspurg dannen den nächsten al<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>hie zuͦ <placeName ref="l473">S. Gallen</placeName> anzaygt, das die gesandten der fürsten demm kayser <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>hayter anzaygt, das sy das Interim in das werk ze bringen gar <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>nit wüssind, das concilium zuͦ <placeName ref="l1107">Trient</placeName> zuͦ continu[i]eren nit gesin<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>net sygend, dann eß alles dess papsts vorhaben verfasse, darin sy <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>zuͦ verwillgen nit wüssind; verhoffind ouch, ir kays.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">mt. werde den <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>gemainen stenden dess reychs dasjenig halten, das inen auf so vil <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>reychstagen so durrlich zuͦgesagt und versprochen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Sy wüssind ouch <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>wider die vernainte rebellen khainen krieg ze fuͦren, weyl sy sich <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ainem freyen concilio underwerfend.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l473">Sangalli</placeName>, 16. octobris, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>anno 1550.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8049">[Ioac]<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>himus Vadianus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>An meister <persName ref="p495">Heinrichen <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullinger</persName>, praedicanten <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>zum großen Münster.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
